idence":["wuwen-q-bbe0c8f2e823266481f3"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-bbe0c8f2e823266481f3","order":4042},{"id":"wuwen-e-63e4bc5025d31aece57a","title":"曹茂：嘉平、正元、景元中，累增邑；并前五千户。","accounts":[{"id":"wuwen-a-63e4bc5025d31aece57a","label":"正文","text":"曹茂：嘉平、正元、景元中，累增邑；并前五千户。","evidence":["wuwen-q-96abee5622beb706d958"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuwen-p-55ebf5222bc39d","role":"受封或迁封者","evidence":["wuwen-q-96abee5622beb706d958"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原句纪年见引文，未审定公元年。","evidence":["wuwen-q-96abee5622beb706d958"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-96abee5622beb706d958","order":4043}],"persons":[{"id":"wuwen-p-55ebf5222bc39d","name":"曹茂","evidence":["wuwen-q-7d60723bcb5d8d0abd12","wuwen-q-78425e3d4ae559d22453","wuwen-q-e9957e317644cc29abf6","wuwen-q-b5b19926ae90506293e4","wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec","wuwen-q-83c6afc8f23a0c83fafa","wuwen-q-494ae8ce0c0a9dd7b89a","wuwen-q-bbe0c8f2e823266481f3","wuwen-q-96abee5622beb706d958","wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","wuwen-q-46454610787d5fece8f5"],"facts":[{"id":"wuwen-f-7d12a3d91230d06f8569","text":"父为曹操；本传记母为赵姬。","evidence":["wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b"]},{"id":"wuwen-f-937366a596781eacf51a","text":"本传记文帝在位时未封曹茂为王。","evidence":["wuwen-q-46454610787d5fece8f5"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuwen-q-46454610787d5fece8f5","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-deff6e0920efc07beec6","layer":"original","quote":"茂性傲佷〖4〗，少无宠于太祖。及文帝世，又独不王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"wuwen-q-494ae8ce0c0a9dd7b89a","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c84d367ef8dad2418d50","layer":"original","quote":"正始三年，东平灵王薨，茂称嗌痛〖13〗，不肯发哀，居处出入自若。有司奏除国土，诏削县一，户五百。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":61},{"id":"wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-86971c5822d3ccf77a3e","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年，徙封聊城公，其年为王。诏曰：“昔象之为虐至甚〖5〗，而大舜犹侯之有庳〖6〗；近汉氏淮南、阜陵〖7〗，皆为乱臣逆子，而犹或及身而复国〖8〗，或至子而锡土。有虞，建之于上古；汉文、明、章，行之乎前代〖9〗：斯皆敦叙亲亲之厚义也。聊城公茂，少不闲礼教，长不务善道。先帝以为古之立诸侯也，皆命贤者，故姬姓有未必侯者；是以独不王茂。太皇太后，数以为言。如闻茂〖10〗，顷来少知悔昔之非，欲修善将来。君子与其进〖11〗，不保其往也。今封茂为聊城王，以慰太皇太后下流之念。”","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":235},{"id":"wuwen-q-78425e3d4ae559d22453","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-720935572d081cd23879","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年〖1〗，改封平舆侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":32},{"id":"wuwen-q-7d60723bcb5d8d0abd12","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-720935572d081cd23879","layer":"original","quote":"乐陵王茂，建安二十二年，封万岁亭侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18},{"id":"wuwen-q-83c6afc8f23a0c83fafa","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c84d367ef8dad2418d50","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖12〗，改封曲阳王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"wuwen-q-96abee5622beb706d958","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c84d367ef8dad2418d50","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平、正元、景元中，累增邑；并前五千户。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":99,"end":119},{"id":"wuwen-q-b5b19926ae90506293e4","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-720935572d081cd23879","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖2〗，徙封中丘〖3〗。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":60},{"id":"wuwen-q-bbe0c8f2e823266481f3","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-c84d367ef8dad2418d50","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖14〗，徙封乐陵〖15〗；诏以茂租奉少，诸子多，复所削户，又增户七百。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":99},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190},{"id":"wuwen-q-e9957e317644cc29abf6","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-720935572d081cd23879","layer":"original","quote":"黄初三年，进爵，徙封乘氏公。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":46}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
